WEBVTT

00:00:03.340 --> 00:00:05.470
Aloma-chan and Mikan-chan?

00:00:07.410 --> 00:00:09.570
With that outfit, does that mean...!

00:00:09.570 --> 00:00:10.390
Gel!

00:00:10.390 --> 00:00:13.000
You're students at Paprika Primary Academy?!

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:13.850
Devi!

00:01:46.070 --> 00:01:48.440
The Devil in the Next Class-nano.

00:01:50.800 --> 00:01:53.120
Onee-chan, I'm heading to school without you.

00:01:53.120 --> 00:01:54.550
Capisce.

00:01:55.040 --> 00:01:56.870
See you later.

00:01:58.280 --> 00:02:02.120
Onee-chan, your friends are here.

00:02:02.120 --> 00:02:03.770
C-Capisce!

00:02:05.740 --> 00:02:08.240
I'm heading out!

00:02:08.240 --> 00:02:10.020
Sorry I took so long, Nao.

00:02:10.020 --> 00:02:10.860
Eh?

00:02:12.050 --> 00:02:12.790
Huh?

00:02:19.740 --> 00:02:21.850
A-Aloma-chan...

00:02:21.850 --> 00:02:22.950
Mikan-chan.

00:02:27.410 --> 00:02:29.330
C-Crows?!

00:02:30.270 --> 00:02:32.680
It's important to have a proper atmosphere.

00:02:33.970 --> 00:02:35.300
What is it?!

00:02:35.300 --> 00:02:40.510
In accordance with the ancient prophecy,
the time hath come for us to show ourselves at school.

00:02:40.510 --> 00:02:43.330
She's saying we should go to school together.

00:02:45.520 --> 00:02:48.440
I-I see...

00:02:48.440 --> 00:02:49.840
Capisce...

00:02:49.840 --> 00:02:52.520
Though, Aloma-chan, isn't it hot with that cloak on?

00:02:52.520 --> 00:02:54.730
The cold is mine enemy.

00:02:55.790 --> 00:02:56.940
Really?!

00:02:56.940 --> 00:02:59.480
You're 6th graders too?!

00:02:59.480 --> 00:03:01.660
Correct.  We're in class 6.

00:03:02.070 --> 00:03:03.840
I'm in 5.

00:03:03.840 --> 00:03:06.000
How long have you been going to Paprika Academy?

00:03:06.000 --> 00:03:07.920
Ever since first grade.

00:03:07.920 --> 00:03:08.690
Really?!

00:03:08.690 --> 00:03:10.740
I feel bad for not recognising you.

00:03:10.740 --> 00:03:12.250
That is to be expected.

00:03:12.250 --> 00:03:12.880
Huh?

00:03:14.150 --> 00:03:16.180
We have done our best to conceal ourselves.

00:03:16.180 --> 00:03:18.260
We've been perfecting our plans in secret,

00:03:19.300 --> 00:03:21.930
awaiting the the arrival of the proper time.

00:03:24.100 --> 00:03:28.560
And finally the time hast come to raise the curtain on our era!

00:03:28.560 --> 00:03:29.450
Oh.

00:03:29.450 --> 00:03:31.580
The battery's out of juice, so it stopped.

00:03:31.580 --> 00:03:35.800
I have no clue what you're talking about.

00:03:35.800 --> 00:03:37.020
Anyway, let's snap!

00:03:37.020 --> 00:03:39.520
Hell's cauldron is not yet open.

00:03:39.520 --> 00:03:40.550
Children?

00:03:40.550 --> 00:03:41.990
It's not time to snap yet.

00:03:41.990 --> 00:03:43.820
Huh? Not yet?

00:03:45.070 --> 00:03:46.870
Mikan will replace the battery.

00:03:46.870 --> 00:03:47.950
Then please see to it.

00:03:47.950 --> 00:03:49.040
And press the button...

00:03:50.290 --> 00:03:53.860
Prophecy Grimoire, chapter 13, section 32:

00:03:53.860 --> 00:03:57.500
"Aloma and Mikan's team, Alomagedon,"

00:03:57.500 --> 00:03:59.480
Alomagedon...

00:03:59.480 --> 00:04:02.890
It's a remnant from the final war
between angels and demons-nano.

00:04:02.890 --> 00:04:07.100
"upon the inclusion of three more idols,
it shall become a team of five."

00:04:07.750 --> 00:04:08.850
In accordance with the prophecy:

00:04:09.790 --> 00:04:12.950
be it SoLaMi Smile or Dressing Parfait,

00:04:12.950 --> 00:04:16.560
it would be best for one team to join Alomagedon!

00:04:16.900 --> 00:04:21.780
So, you're basically looking to form a five person team with us?

00:04:21.780 --> 00:04:24.650
That is the prophecy! That is our fate!

00:04:24.650 --> 00:04:28.490
With the three of ye, we can form a Dream Team.

00:04:29.130 --> 00:04:30.780
So, what dost thou say?

00:04:30.780 --> 00:04:33.210
Even if you ask me,

00:04:33.680 --> 00:04:36.440
I have to talk with Mirelle and Sophie first.

00:04:36.440 --> 00:04:38.350
By the way, we're going to be late-nano.

00:04:38.920 --> 00:04:45.600
Good morning.

00:04:45.600 --> 00:04:47.800
Morning.

00:04:49.230 --> 00:04:50.220
Perfect timing.

00:04:50.220 --> 00:04:51.550
Now go ahead and ask her.

00:04:51.550 --> 00:04:53.870
C-Capisce...

00:04:53.870 --> 00:04:55.270
President Minami!

00:04:55.600 --> 00:04:57.380
Morning, Manaka-san.

00:04:57.380 --> 00:05:02.570
Aloma-chan and Mikan-chan asked if SoLaMi Smile
would like to join Alomagedon.

00:05:03.370 --> 00:05:07.020
To join Aloma-chan and Mikan-chan...?

00:05:07.020 --> 00:05:08.990
Yeah, they said to join.

00:05:08.990 --> 00:05:12.620
To join them?!

00:05:13.780 --> 00:05:16.500
Kurosu Aloma-san. Shiratama Mikan-san.

00:05:16.500 --> 00:05:18.850
So you're Alomagedon.

00:05:18.850 --> 00:05:21.170
You already know them?

00:05:21.620 --> 00:05:25.900
As the Public Morals President and as the Student Council President,

00:05:25.900 --> 00:05:30.140
I'd obviously know the names and faces of every student.

00:05:30.640 --> 00:05:33.070
But, even if you say that...

00:05:33.070 --> 00:05:37.720
Kurosu-san has always been a quiet girl who is often found in the academy's library.

00:05:37.720 --> 00:05:43.420
Her PriPara persona is so different
that I never even considered it.

00:05:43.420 --> 00:05:44.930
As intended.

00:05:44.930 --> 00:05:48.160
The form I held until now was but temporary.

00:05:48.160 --> 00:05:49.950
She said she's been waiting for this moment.

00:05:49.950 --> 00:05:52.340
We are Alomagedon!

00:05:52.340 --> 00:05:53.910
Devidevi Devil!

00:05:54.540 --> 00:05:58.250
We're here to tell everyone about our PriPara Debut-nano!

00:05:58.250 --> 00:05:59.580
Gel-gel!

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:02.550
This is also in accordance with the Prophecy Grimoire.

00:06:02.550 --> 00:06:04.650
Nano!

00:06:04.650 --> 00:06:06.720
What's with those two?

00:06:10.180 --> 00:06:14.700
Since the teacher in charge of class 6 is out with a cold,

00:06:14.700 --> 00:06:16.640
we're forming a joint class with class 5.

00:06:16.640 --> 00:06:19.480
Do your best to get along.

00:06:19.480 --> 00:06:21.610
C-Capisce!

00:06:21.610 --> 00:06:25.360
If you add lemon to mallow blue tea,

00:06:25.360 --> 00:06:28.370
the colour will change from blue to pink.

00:06:28.370 --> 00:06:30.320
Now please try it yourselves.

00:06:33.450 --> 00:06:34.220
Wow!

00:06:34.220 --> 00:06:35.290
Cool!

00:06:35.290 --> 00:06:36.700
The colour changed!

00:06:36.700 --> 00:06:37.570
It's so pretty.

00:06:37.570 --> 00:06:38.750
Bravo!

00:06:38.750 --> 00:06:42.900
Derodero Derosaiumu!

00:06:42.900 --> 00:06:45.320
Devidevi Devil!

00:06:47.420 --> 00:06:48.660
It changed!

00:06:48.660 --> 00:06:50.170
It's magic-nano!

00:06:50.170 --> 00:06:52.480
You may be wondering why it changed.

00:06:52.480 --> 00:06:58.210
When the lemon is added to mallow blue tea,
its acidity reacts with the anthocyanin.

00:06:58.210 --> 00:06:59.660
That is not all.

00:06:59.660 --> 00:07:00.460
Huh?

00:07:00.460 --> 00:07:02.620
Derodero Derosaiumu!

00:07:11.070 --> 00:07:14.340
This is also a demon's power!

00:07:14.340 --> 00:07:18.000
So this is how she made all those smoke screens!

00:07:18.000 --> 00:07:20.320
Devidevi Devidevi Devidevi Devil~!
Kurosu-san, what are you doing?

00:07:20.320 --> 00:07:24.800
Paprika Academy rule number 666:

00:07:24.800 --> 00:07:25.710
President!

00:07:26.230 --> 00:07:31.030
"When taking part in science experiments, students are not to mix dry ice and liquid without the teacher's permission!"

00:07:31.030 --> 00:07:35.430
Kurosu Aloma-san, take note as I issue you your first insubordination ticket!

00:07:42.190 --> 00:07:44.420
This is not the time nor place to be playing demon.

00:07:44.420 --> 00:07:46.110
I am not playing.

00:07:46.110 --> 00:07:48.050
I <i>am</i> a demon.

00:07:48.050 --> 00:07:49.680
Aloma is a demon-nano.

00:07:49.680 --> 00:07:51.510
And Mikan is an angel-nano!

00:07:51.510 --> 00:07:52.570
Listen here...

00:07:52.910 --> 00:07:56.080
And with this I hath proof!

00:07:56.080 --> 00:07:59.610
This insubordination ticket is for rule 666!

00:08:01.000 --> 00:08:03.250
Rule 666...

00:08:03.250 --> 00:08:06.240
What's that got to do with it?

00:08:06.240 --> 00:08:08.020
The number 666 is...

00:08:08.020 --> 00:08:09.590
...the devil's number!

00:08:09.590 --> 00:08:12.050
Eh?!

00:08:12.510 --> 00:08:13.870
I-It's just a coincidence.

00:08:13.870 --> 00:08:14.930
Not quite.

00:08:14.930 --> 00:08:17.110
This is proof I'm a demon...

00:08:17.110 --> 00:08:19.010
This be the devil's proof!

00:08:19.010 --> 00:08:21.570
That's not what devil's proof means.

00:08:21.570 --> 00:08:25.980
Devil's proof is a term used when trying to prove the existence of something that can't be proven.

00:08:25.980 --> 00:08:27.720
Devidevi.

00:08:27.720 --> 00:08:30.430
Coincidently, the day that I descended upon this earth...

00:08:30.430 --> 00:08:31.850
Her birthday...

00:08:31.850 --> 00:08:33.150
...was June 6th.

00:08:34.450 --> 00:08:36.120
I'm also in class 6-6.

00:08:37.720 --> 00:08:41.160
This proves that I'm a demon!

00:08:41.160 --> 00:08:42.880
This proves...

00:08:42.880 --> 00:08:44.620
...she's a demon?!

00:08:44.620 --> 00:08:45.090
Devi devi devi devi devi devi devi!

00:08:45.090 --> 00:08:47.330
Yes, yes, Kurosu Aloma-san...

00:08:48.510 --> 00:08:50.860
Please stand out in the hallway.

00:08:50.860 --> 00:08:52.000
Devi...

00:08:55.480 --> 00:08:56.610
Over here!

00:08:57.810 --> 00:09:00.140
<i>We're also doing PE together...</i>

00:09:02.590 --> 00:09:03.600
Mikan-chan?

00:09:03.600 --> 00:09:09.400
Gel!

00:09:09.740 --> 00:09:11.890
Just like an angel!

00:09:11.890 --> 00:09:13.580
Lala-chan, watch out!

00:09:16.860 --> 00:09:19.340
Capisce...

00:09:20.080 --> 00:09:22.390
Manaka-san, are you okay?!

00:09:22.390 --> 00:09:23.960
Shiratama Mikan-san!

00:09:23.960 --> 00:09:25.870
We're playing basketball right now!

00:09:25.870 --> 00:09:28.000
Don't just go and do the high jump without permission!

00:09:28.500 --> 00:09:30.490
So it's Mikan this time!

00:09:30.490 --> 00:09:34.340
Shiratama Mikan-san,  take note as I issue you your first insubordination ticket.

00:09:34.340 --> 00:09:36.000
School rule number 104:

00:09:36.000 --> 00:09:39.010
"Students are not to high jump
without the teachers permission!"

00:09:39.010 --> 00:09:40.930
Gel...

00:09:42.920 --> 00:09:44.950
Mikan is an angel-nano!

00:09:44.950 --> 00:09:47.650
One should just do what they want when they want-nano!

00:09:47.650 --> 00:09:50.110
At least, according to Aloma-nano!

00:09:50.460 --> 00:09:52.020
Playing angel and demon...

00:09:52.020 --> 00:09:53.320
We're not playing!

00:09:54.330 --> 00:09:55.400
Kurosu-san?

00:09:55.800 --> 00:09:57.490
Mikan is an angel.

00:09:57.490 --> 00:09:59.450
What now?!
Mikan is an angel-nano!

00:09:59.450 --> 00:10:01.720
Mikan broke rule 104.

00:10:01.720 --> 00:10:02.700
What of it?

00:10:03.020 --> 00:10:05.080
104, or in other words:

00:10:05.080 --> 00:10:06.470
Angel.

00:10:06.470 --> 00:10:07.360
Gel.

00:10:07.360 --> 00:10:08.460
She's an angel!

00:10:08.460 --> 00:10:09.140
Wow!

00:10:09.140 --> 00:10:09.770
Amazing!

00:10:09.770 --> 00:10:11.420
Angel!
I get it!

00:10:11.420 --> 00:10:13.730
She's an angel!
Mikan Mikan Mikan!

00:10:13.730 --> 00:10:14.630
Awesome!

00:10:15.070 --> 00:10:16.340
Angel...

00:10:16.340 --> 00:10:17.620
This proves...

00:10:17.620 --> 00:10:18.280
Gel-gel!

00:10:18.280 --> 00:10:20.300
...that Mikan is an angel!

00:10:20.300 --> 00:10:22.250
Yes, yes. Please stand outside.

00:10:22.250 --> 00:10:25.080
Jelly-jelly Angely!

00:10:25.080 --> 00:10:25.780
Devi...

00:10:25.780 --> 00:10:27.230
Gel!

00:10:28.420 --> 00:10:30.960
It seems Alomagedon's members are 6th graders.

00:10:30.960 --> 00:10:32.990
And listen to this, they're in class 6.

00:10:32.990 --> 00:10:36.220
I heard it's Shiratama Mikan-chan and Kurosu Aloma-chan.

00:10:36.220 --> 00:10:37.920
Their acting is superb!

00:10:37.920 --> 00:10:38.690
Oh?

00:10:38.690 --> 00:10:42.340
Aloma broke rule 666, which is the devil's number!

00:10:42.340 --> 00:10:44.600
And Mikan broke rule 104, which makes her an angel.

00:10:44.600 --> 00:10:46.690
They're thorough with the characters they've created.

00:10:46.690 --> 00:10:50.260
Being able to use those complex words is so cool!

00:10:50.260 --> 00:10:51.400
Even if they are confusing...

00:10:51.400 --> 00:10:54.590
Their angel and demon personas are super awesome!

00:10:54.590 --> 00:10:58.590
Onee-chan, can you get me Aloma-sama's and Mikan-sama's autograph?!

00:10:58.590 --> 00:11:01.490
Since when have you been an Alomagedon fan, Non?!

00:11:01.490 --> 00:11:03.160
Since their début concert.

00:11:03.160 --> 00:11:04.990
They were awesome!

00:11:04.990 --> 00:11:07.270
Devi! Devidevi Devi!

00:11:07.270 --> 00:11:09.310
Even Principal Ookanda...

00:11:09.310 --> 00:11:13.230
DeviGel! GelDevi! Devil! Woo!

00:11:21.030 --> 00:11:22.550
Devidevi...

00:11:29.240 --> 00:11:31.210
Let's talk.

00:11:43.450 --> 00:11:50.830
So you knew about, and planned on breaking, rule number 666, huh?

00:11:50.830 --> 00:11:54.900
All that in order to leave the lasting impression that you are a demon.

00:11:55.560 --> 00:11:57.940
And the same goes for rule 104,

00:11:57.940 --> 00:12:00.610
it was all to show her off as an angel.

00:12:01.260 --> 00:12:04.830
President Minami, thou are naïve!

00:12:04.830 --> 00:12:05.950
Me?

00:12:06.330 --> 00:12:10.010
School rules, after all, are rules that others have created.

00:12:10.010 --> 00:12:13.360
And as president, thou are simply dancing in the palms of their hands.

00:12:14.370 --> 00:12:16.530
Getting to the point...

00:12:16.530 --> 00:12:18.540
I scribed all of these!

00:12:18.540 --> 00:12:23.130
Namely the 666 prophecy grimoires summoned from the depths of hell.

00:12:23.490 --> 00:12:26.420
666 grimoires?!

00:12:26.420 --> 00:12:29.400
A demon cannot be created in a single day.

00:12:29.400 --> 00:12:33.310
It hath taken 666 grimoires to shape my character!

00:12:33.840 --> 00:12:36.540
My character is impeccable.

00:12:36.540 --> 00:12:40.140
Of course, being in class 6-6 was by chance,

00:12:40.140 --> 00:12:43.030
but to call forth such a coincidence is a power I possess.

00:12:43.400 --> 00:12:45.810
So that time it suddenly turned to night,

00:12:45.810 --> 00:12:49.070
you'll even say that was part of your power, huh?

00:12:49.700 --> 00:12:53.960
On the other hand, thy character can be created in but seconds!

00:12:53.960 --> 00:12:56.010
It fits on a single page!

00:12:56.010 --> 00:12:58.980
See here, thine sentence ending "pri"...

00:12:58.980 --> 00:13:01.700
...and thine catch phrase "A pop and a step and I've gotcha!"...

00:13:01.700 --> 00:13:03.420
That's but two lines!

00:13:03.420 --> 00:13:04.630
It's far too simple.

00:13:06.130 --> 00:13:08.430
The era of angels and demons is upon us!

00:13:08.920 --> 00:13:13.050
Thou hath said my devil character was a complete failure,

00:13:13.050 --> 00:13:15.160
but it's plenty clear that thee were wrong.

00:13:15.160 --> 00:13:17.890
Angel and demon idols are popular.

00:13:19.130 --> 00:13:22.290
Moreover, we shall surpass Divine Idols,

00:13:22.290 --> 00:13:26.400
and reign supreme over PriPara as an angel idol and demon idol!

00:13:26.400 --> 00:13:31.370
If SoLaMi Smile would like to join Alomagedon, it would be best to make ye desires known.

00:13:32.230 --> 00:13:35.050
As if anyone would want to join you girls!

00:13:35.050 --> 00:13:36.830
I see.  Then leave.

00:13:38.980 --> 00:13:41.290
I have Library Committee activities to attend to.

00:13:41.290 --> 00:13:44.050
Light Demon Club hast no time to waste.

00:13:44.050 --> 00:13:46.260
Demons are busy.

00:13:46.260 --> 00:13:48.860
After all, I am its only member.

00:13:48.860 --> 00:13:51.390
<i>Why you...!</i>

00:13:55.150 --> 00:13:57.410
President Minami lost an argument!

00:13:57.410 --> 00:13:58.980
Aloma-chan sure is amazing!

00:13:59.790 --> 00:14:01.590
She really is a demon.

00:14:02.940 --> 00:14:07.910
Devidevi Devil!
Gel!

00:14:07.910 --> 00:14:11.370
Angels and demons are the best-usa!
Angels and demons are the best-kuma!

00:14:12.210 --> 00:14:15.410
Neko-neesan, right there. Yes, right there-kuma!

00:14:15.410 --> 00:14:19.420
A little lower. Ah! Yes! Right there-usa!

00:14:19.420 --> 00:14:22.340
You guys really are cute-nekon!

00:14:22.970 --> 00:14:23.990
Oh.

00:14:23.990 --> 00:14:26.300
It's about time for their concert-nekon.

00:14:27.360 --> 00:14:29.260
Angels and demons...

00:14:29.260 --> 00:14:34.220
So the Alomagedon boom has taken over both Paprika Academy and PriPara...

00:14:36.250 --> 00:14:38.160
Speak of the devil! It's Alomagedon!

00:14:38.160 --> 00:14:42.900
Dressing Parfait, ye are welcome to join Alomagedon if you would like.

00:14:42.900 --> 00:14:44.000
What?!

00:14:44.000 --> 00:14:46.560
You're just looking down on us by saying "ye are welcome to join"!

00:14:46.560 --> 00:14:49.500
It'd be better if you had a friend ticket and said please!

00:14:49.500 --> 00:14:53.260
You should have grovelled before us and spun three times while barking!

00:14:53.260 --> 00:14:55.740
Dorthy, you did it yourself!

00:14:55.740 --> 00:14:59.070
Those evil words are like a demon's.

00:14:59.070 --> 00:15:00.210
Do you not agree?

00:15:01.830 --> 00:15:06.300
Dressing Parfait, we are... are...

00:15:11.250 --> 00:15:13.810
....are open minded and will accept you.

00:15:13.810 --> 00:15:14.900
Will accept us?!

00:15:14.900 --> 00:15:16.110
We decline!

00:15:16.110 --> 00:15:17.010
Right, Leona?

00:15:17.010 --> 00:15:19.890
Y-Yeah, if you say so, Dorthy.

00:15:19.890 --> 00:15:24.040
While the contrast between white and black is appealing,

00:15:24.040 --> 00:15:25.490
it's meaningless!

00:15:25.490 --> 00:15:27.280
It's suspicious and lacks credibility.

00:15:27.280 --> 00:15:29.420
It's best not to rush thy resignation.

00:15:29.420 --> 00:15:30.120
Huh?

00:15:30.120 --> 00:15:30.860
Devi!

00:15:30.860 --> 00:15:33.780
We made a fresh start and have more appeal.

00:15:33.780 --> 00:15:34.840
Y-Yeah.

00:15:34.840 --> 00:15:37.490
It's best not to rush your decision or appeal.

00:15:37.490 --> 00:15:39.330
Time is precious-nano.

00:15:39.330 --> 00:15:41.370
Take your time to consider it.

00:15:41.370 --> 00:15:43.890
If ye choose to join, ye are welcome to come at any time.

00:15:43.890 --> 00:15:44.860
Devidevi!

00:15:44.860 --> 00:15:46.300
Gel-gel!

00:15:50.330 --> 00:15:53.430
Please scan the appropriate number
of My Tickets for your coord.

00:15:53.430 --> 00:15:55.850
You can also scan each other's Friend Tickets.

00:15:56.560 --> 00:15:58.710
Coord Change Start!

00:16:00.230 --> 00:16:04.290
The neckline and skirt are in the image of an angel's wings.

00:16:04.290 --> 00:16:07.220
And the sun brooch is a wonderful accessory!

00:16:07.220 --> 00:16:10.070
Sweet Angel White Coord!

00:16:10.070 --> 00:16:11.950
Gel!

00:16:12.560 --> 00:16:16.120
Everyone's eyes will be drawn to the western styled demon wings.

00:16:16.120 --> 00:16:19.080
And the moon brooch adds a mysterious brightness.

00:16:19.080 --> 00:16:21.960
Cheeky Little Succubus Coord!

00:16:21.960 --> 00:16:23.670
Devi!

00:16:27.030 --> 00:16:28.640
Aloma-chan's cute!

00:16:28.640 --> 00:16:31.720
Mikan-chan's so cute!

00:16:32.380 --> 00:16:33.620
Darkness!

00:16:33.620 --> 00:16:36.180
As the devil's servants, may ye all be cursed!

00:16:38.140 --> 00:16:39.460
Shining!

00:16:39.460 --> 00:16:41.650
You're all children of heaven-nano.

00:16:41.650 --> 00:16:43.770
May it cancel out the curse-nano.

00:16:43.770 --> 00:16:47.560
Those who pass through PriPara's gate, abandon all hope!

00:16:48.860 --> 00:16:53.070
No, an angel shall save your soul!

00:16:53.070 --> 00:16:53.950
Aloma and...

00:16:53.950 --> 00:16:55.030
Mikan...

00:16:55.030 --> 00:16:56.700
An angel and demon...

00:16:56.700 --> 00:16:59.410
...shall take you to heaven.

00:16:59.410 --> 00:17:00.950
No, to hell.

00:17:01.290 --> 00:17:03.460
Take me!

00:18:22.410 --> 00:18:25.950
Making Drama Switch On!

00:18:28.120 --> 00:18:31.100
Go, my servants!

00:18:31.100 --> 00:18:33.620
When called, we fly out!

00:18:33.620 --> 00:18:34.380
Huh?

00:18:37.610 --> 00:18:41.640
Dazzling PriParapedia Labyrinth!

00:18:41.640 --> 00:18:43.560
Mikan's so happy!

00:18:45.180 --> 00:18:48.200
Cyalume Change!

00:18:53.370 --> 00:18:54.730
Devi!

00:19:34.690 --> 00:19:36.730
Aloma-chan, I love you!

00:19:36.730 --> 00:19:38.490
I love Mikan!

00:19:42.260 --> 00:19:45.660
Alomagedon has improved their ranking with that wonderful performance.

00:19:45.660 --> 00:19:47.790
They're now Noteworthy Idols.

00:19:51.180 --> 00:19:53.220
They're already Noteworthy Idols?!

00:19:53.220 --> 00:19:56.810
They've been flying through the rankings ever since they débuted.

00:19:56.810 --> 00:19:59.470
Yeah! They had another nice concert today-kuma.

00:19:59.470 --> 00:20:02.500
Even when full of darkness, they still shine-usa.

00:20:02.500 --> 00:20:03.220
Huh?

00:20:03.220 --> 00:20:05.260
They're full-fledged fans now-pri!

00:20:05.260 --> 00:20:09.890
You can go to heaven faster than you can say "ah"-nano.

00:20:09.890 --> 00:20:11.730
No, not "ah"...

00:20:15.140 --> 00:20:17.940
But faster than you can say "demon"!

00:20:18.840 --> 00:20:19.800
Of course!

00:20:19.800 --> 00:20:21.230
What a cool saying!

00:20:21.230 --> 00:20:22.630
Demons are cool!

00:20:22.630 --> 00:20:24.260
Angels and demons!

00:20:24.260 --> 00:20:30.620
Alomagedon!

00:20:30.620 --> 00:20:32.040
That was brilliant-nekon!

00:20:32.040 --> 00:20:33.020
Alomagedon!

00:20:33.020 --> 00:20:34.240
Devidevi.

00:20:34.240 --> 00:20:37.750
Alomagedon!

00:20:37.750 --> 00:20:39.490
There! Right there-neko~!

00:20:39.490 --> 00:20:43.760
Dressing Parfait, would you like to join our team?

00:20:43.760 --> 00:20:45.400
Devidevi devidevi.

00:20:46.640 --> 00:20:48.760
No, it's too soon.

00:20:48.760 --> 00:20:51.390
They did ask. So why not join them-usa?

00:20:51.900 --> 00:20:53.270
Usagi-san?!

00:20:53.270 --> 00:20:57.360
It's about time you formed your five person team.

00:20:57.360 --> 00:21:00.900
The Dream Team Alomagedoressing Parfait.

00:21:00.900 --> 00:21:04.850
I wouldn't mind being your manager with Neko-neesan-usa.

00:21:04.850 --> 00:21:06.200
Kuma kick!

00:21:06.200 --> 00:21:08.520
Trying to keep Neko-neesan to yourself-kuma?!

00:21:08.520 --> 00:21:10.290
I won't let that happen-kuma!

00:21:10.780 --> 00:21:16.130
If Dressing Parfait and Alomagedon team up...

00:21:16.130 --> 00:21:17.500
Gel!
Devi!

00:21:18.030 --> 00:21:20.660
...they'll be a formidable opponent-pri.

00:21:20.660 --> 00:21:21.710
Yeah.

00:21:22.070 --> 00:21:26.530
Now then, let's turn the page on yet another prophecy.

00:21:26.530 --> 00:21:29.190
It's the beginning of the future!

00:21:29.190 --> 00:21:34.850
Alomagedon!

00:23:06.050 --> 00:23:09.490
I wonder what Aloma-chan and Mikan-chan were like as kids.

00:23:09.490 --> 00:23:12.490
Aloma-chan talks like a demon.

00:23:12.490 --> 00:23:14.490
She's always been like that.

00:23:14.490 --> 00:23:16.080
Eh? Really?!

00:23:16.080 --> 00:23:17.870
When we attended nursery school together,

00:23:17.870 --> 00:23:19.910
something happened that changed Aloma.

00:23:19.910 --> 00:23:21.670
Oh? What happened?!

00:23:21.670 --> 00:23:22.820
That's enough, Mikan!

00:23:22.820 --> 00:23:25.550
If you say any more, I'll curse you for life.

00:23:25.550 --> 00:23:26.480
Eh?!

00:23:26.480 --> 00:23:28.670
Just what kind of relationship do they have?!

00:23:28.670 --> 00:23:29.680
Next time:

00:23:29.680 --> 00:23:31.750
Devi & En Nursery School! Kero?

00:23:31.750 --> 00:23:33.070
Aim for your dreams!

00:23:33.070 --> 00:23:34.720
Let's go PriPara!
